#: ../../index.rst:1
msgid ""
"Guidedog builds documentation websites and PDF books from "
"reStructuredText and Markdown."
msgstr "Guidedog 用 reStructuredText 和 Markdown 生成文档网站和 PDF 图书。"

#: ../../index.rst:5
msgid "Guidedog"
msgstr "Guidedog"

#: ../../index.rst:10
msgid "Write once. Explain well. Publish on the web and on paper."
msgstr "写一次，讲清楚，发布到网页，也印在纸上。"

#: ../../index.rst:14
msgid ""
"Guidedog builds a documentation website and a PDF book from the same "
"reStructuredText or Markdown files. We write the text once. Guidedog "
"keeps the two editions in step."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 用同一组 reStructuredText 或 Markdown 文件生成文档网站和 PDF 图书。文字我们只写一次，两个版本由 Guidedog 保持同步。"

#: ../../index.rst:20
msgid ""
"`Read the manual <manual_>`_ `Download <download_>`_ `Source code "
"<source_>`_"
msgstr "`阅读手册 <manual_>`_ `下载 <download_>`_ `源代码 <source_>`_"

#: ../../index.rst:31
msgid ""
"A plain text file goes in. Guidedog makes a web page and a book page from "
"it."
msgstr "输入一个纯文本文件，Guidedog 用它生成一个网页和一页书。"

#: ../../index.rst:34
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "它做什么"

#: ../../index.rst:39
msgid ""
"**A website.** Pages with navigation, search, highlighted code, and light "
"and dark themes, from Jinja templates we can change as much as we like."
msgstr "**网站。** 页面带有导航、搜索、代码高亮以及浅色和深色主题，由 Jinja 模板生成，这些模板我们可以随意修改。"

#: ../../index.rst:41
msgid ""
"**A PDF book.** Chapters, cross-references, figures, tables, footnotes, "
"and an index, set by Typst with hyphenation for each language."
msgstr "**PDF 图书。** 章节、交叉引用、图、表、脚注和索引，由 Typst 按各语言的规则排版。"

#: ../../index.rst:43
msgid ""
"**reStructuredText and Markdown.** Directives, roles, toctrees, and "
"cross-references work as Sphinx users expect, and MyST Markdown can sit "
"next to them."
msgstr ""
"**reStructuredText 与 Markdown。** 指令、角色、目录树和交叉引用的用法与 Sphinx 用户熟悉的一致，MyST "
"Markdown 也可以放在一起使用。"

#: ../../index.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Translations.** Gettext catalogs carry a project into other languages. "
"Chinese, Japanese, Korean, and Hindi text is laid out correctly on screen "
"and on paper."
msgstr "**翻译。** 用 gettext 目录把项目译成其他语言。中文、日文、韩文和印地文在屏幕上和纸面上都能正确排版。"

#: ../../index.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Diagrams, math, and API pages.** Graphviz diagrams, LaTeX equations, "
"and API reference for Rust, Python, and Odin, read from source code."
msgstr ""
"**图表、公式与 API 页面。** Graphviz 图表、LaTeX 公式，以及从源代码读取的 Rust、Python 和 Odin API 参考。"

#: ../../index.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Clear errors.** A message says what is wrong, where, and how to fix it. "
"A failed build leaves the last good site in place."
msgstr "**清楚的错误信息。** 信息说明出了什么问题、在哪里、怎样修复。构建失败时，上一次成功的网站保持不变。"

#: ../../index.rst:53
msgid "One program"
msgstr "一个程序"

#: ../../index.rst:56
msgid ""
"Guidedog is a single binary. We do not need a Python environment, a LaTeX "
"installation, or separate theme and extension packages. Configuration is "
"a TOML file. Templates are plain files in our project, and we can edit "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog 是一个单独的可执行文件。我们不需要 Python 环境，不需要安装 LaTeX，也不需要另装主题或扩展包。配置是一个 TOML 文件。模板是项目里的普通文件，我们可以直接编辑。"

#: ../../index.rst:60
msgid ""
"Some things still come from outside. The Typst compiler is built into "
"Guidedog. A build without it uses the ``typst`` program installed on the "
"system. Diagrams use the system's Graphviz library, and fetching remote "
"inventories uses the ``curl`` program."
msgstr ""
"有些东西仍然来自外部。Typst 编译器内置在 Guidedog 中；不带它构建的版本会使用系统中安装的 ``typst`` 程序。图表使用系统的 Graphviz 库，获取远程清单则使用 ``curl`` 程序。"

#: ../../index.rst:66
msgid "Write it, see both"
msgstr "写一次，看两种结果"

#: ../../index.rst:69
msgid ""
"On the left is reStructuredText. On the right is what Guidedog made of it "
"on this page. The PDF builder sets the same lines as a book page."
msgstr "左边是 reStructuredText，右边是 Guidedog 在本页上用它生成的结果。PDF 构建器会把同样的内容排成书页。"

#: ../../index.rst:74
msgid ""
".. note::\n"
"\n"
"   Guidedog reads our text once.\n"
"\n"
"The *same* files become a **website**\n"
"and a **book**:\n"
"\n"
".. list-table::\n"
"   :header-rows: 1\n"
"\n"
"   * - Builder\n"
"     - Result\n"
"   * - ``html``\n"
"     - A website\n"
"   * - ``pdf``\n"
"     - A PDF book"
msgstr ""
".. note::\n"
"\n"
"   Guidedog 只读取一次我们写的文字。\n"
"\n"
"*同一组* 文件既成为 **网站**\n"
"也成为 **图书**：\n"
"\n"
".. list-table::\n"
"   :header-rows: 1\n"
"\n"
"   * - 构建器\n"
"     - 结果\n"
"   * - ``html``\n"
"     - 网站\n"
"   * - ``pdf``\n"
"     - PDF 图书"

#: ../../index.rst:97
msgid "Guidedog reads our text once."
msgstr "Guidedog 只读取一次我们写的文字。"

#: ../../index.rst:99
msgid "The *same* files become a **website** and a **book**:"
msgstr "*同一组* 文件既成为 **网站** 也成为 **图书**："

#: ../../index.rst:105
msgid "Builder"
msgstr "构建器"

#: ../../index.rst:106
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../index.rst:107
msgid "``html``"
msgstr "``html``"

#: ../../index.rst:108
msgid "A website"
msgstr "网站"

#: ../../index.rst:109
msgid "``pdf``"
msgstr "``pdf``"

#: ../../index.rst:110
msgid "A PDF book"
msgstr "PDF 图书"

#: ../../index.rst:114
msgid ""
"The `manual as a PDF book <manual-pdf_>`_ is an example of the result on "
"paper. It is built from the same files as the manual's website."
msgstr "`PDF 版手册 <manual-pdf_>`_ 就是纸面效果的一个例子。它和手册网站来自同一组文件。"

#: ../../index.rst:118
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "开始使用"

#: ../../index.rst:121
msgid ""
"Download the archive for our system from the `latest release "
"<download_>`_, put ``guidedog`` on the ``PATH``, and create a project:"
msgstr ""
"从 `最新发布版本 <download_>`_ 下载对应系统的压缩包，把 ``guidedog`` 放到 ``PATH`` 中，然后创建一个项目："

#: ../../index.rst:124
msgid ""
"guidedog quickstart docs\n"
"guidedog build html docs\n"
"guidedog build pdf docs\n"
"guidedog serve docs"
msgstr ""
"guidedog quickstart docs\n"
"guidedog build html docs\n"
"guidedog build pdf docs\n"
"guidedog serve docs"

#: ../../index.rst:131
msgid ""
"``quickstart`` writes ``conf.toml``, ``index.rst``, and templates we can "
"edit. ``serve`` rebuilds the site while we write. The `tutorial "
"<manual-tutorial_>`_ walks through a first project. To build Guidedog "
"from source, install Rust and follow the `instructions in the repository "
"<build_>`_."
msgstr ""
"``quickstart`` 会写出 ``conf.toml``、``index.rst`` 和可以编辑的模板。``serve`` 会在我们写作时重新构建网站。 `教程 <manual-tutorial_>`_ 带我们完成第一个项目。要从源代码构建 Guidedog，请安装 Rust，并按照 `仓库中的说明 <build_>`_ 操作。"

#: ../../index.rst:137
msgid "Design discussions"
msgstr "设计讨论"

#: ../../index.rst:140
msgid ""
"Guidedog's design decisions are written down as numbered discussions: the "
"problem, the alternatives, the decision, and the evidence. We can read "
"each one on the web or download it as a PDF."
msgstr "Guidedog 的设计决定都写成了编号的讨论记录：问题、备选方案、决定和依据。每一篇我们都可以在网页上阅读，也可以下载 PDF。"

#: ../../index.rst:144
msgid ""
"Our own project can keep its discussions the same way, with ``dsc``. It "
"comes with Guidedog. The `manual <manual-discussions_>`_ shows how."
msgstr ""
"我们自己的项目也可以用同样的方式记录讨论，工具是 ``dsc``。它随 Guidedog 一起提供。 `手册 <manual-discussions_>`_ 介绍了做法。"

#: ../../index.rst:149
msgid "`Read the discussions <discussions_>`_"
msgstr "`阅读设计讨论 <discussions_>`_"
